  message: "Fixed in PR #2200. Re-ran the filed forms with --include-docs: `@extends`, `@yield` and `@component` with a second argument emitted nothing on dev, and the `@yield('after')` following the dropped `@component` had scope (); all three are emitted now and that `@yield` is scoped ('outer',). koel: 0 of its 4 Blade symbols moved. This item is NOT about `@if` / `@foreach` scopes (a scheme decision; not done). NOT DONE (filed): `<x-component>` tags, `@include` edges, `@slot` / `@push` scopes, case-insensitive directive names. NOT MEASURED: corpus impact beyond koel. Repro record (both arms, commands and copied outputs): ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/stable_id_items_review_11152026/pr2/tracker/repros.md; per-package detail: pr2/STATUS.md; churn: pr2/final_measure.txt."  # 91ec
